+## Repository layout
+
+| File | Purpose |
+|---|---|
+| `docker-compose.yml` | Starts SereneDB locally with the `./data` folder mounted. |
+| `load_data.py` | Downloads BGL + OpenStack from Zenodo, creates the schema, loads both tables and the ownership table, and verifies row counts. |
+| `ownership.csv` | Fictional component → team mapping (see **Ownership table** below). |
